{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"fa5fd6bb6d1dfb3b","__entryId":"switch","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px\">消息通知</div>\n          <div class=\"switch-sc-row\" style=\"border-top:0\"><span>📩 新消息通知<small>收到私信或评论时提醒我</small></span><label class=\"demo-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n          <div class=\"switch-sc-row\"><span>🔔 声音提醒<small>新消息到达时播放提示音</small></span><label class=\"demo-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n          <div class=\"switch-sc-row\"><span>🌙 免打扰模式<small>23:00 – 8:00 不再提醒</small></span><label class=\"demo-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n        </div>","<div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px\">外观</div>\n          <div class=\"switch-sc-row\" style=\"border-top:0\"><span>🌙 深色模式<small>切换后整个界面立即换肤</small></span><label class=\"demo-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px\">\n            <div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\"><div style=\"height:6px;width:60%;background:var(--bg-hover);border-radius:3px;margin-bottom:5px\"></div>浅色</div>\n            <div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--brand);background:#1d2129;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;font-size:12px;color:#86909c\"><div style=\"height:6px;width:60%;background:#3a3f4a;border-radius:3px;margin-bottom:5px\"></div>深色 ✓</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:cente